### Swagger UI: http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html
### Save a synthetic case (totChol and glucose in mmol/L)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "male": 1,
  "age": 48,
  "education": 2,
  "currentSmoker": 0,
  "cigsPerDay": 0,
  "BPMeds": 0,
  "prevalentStroke": 0,
  "prevalentHyp": 0,
  "diabetes": 0,
  "totChol": 5.4,
  "sysBP": 125.0,
  "diaBP": 82.0,
  "BMI": 27.3,
  "heartRate": 71.0,
  "glucose": 5.1
}

### List records
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cases

### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### POST /api/predictions requires a real trained model and currently returns HTTP 503
